item.description:
Yes, appreciation is illusive. Naturally so, (I suppose) for otherwise one would not &#039;hunt &amp; gather&#039; as earnestly. Nuts!
Speaking of &quot;Love, Frugality, &amp; Humility&quot;, reminds me of...
&lt;a href=&quot;https://centertao.local/tao-te-ching/dc-lau/#chapter-67&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;I have three treasures Which I hold and cherish. The first is known as compassion, The second is known as frugality, The third is known as not daring to take the lead in the empire;&lt;/a&gt;
